            <ArticleTitle>A pocket calculator program for using Pozen's formula.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>155-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pozen's formula has been shown to improve diagnostic accuracy in patients with acute chest pain. This paper describes a short program for the HP-41CV calculator which reliably calculates acute ischemic heart disease probabilities using Pozen's formula.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
